{
 "about": "Node60 power shapes, stage 1 (2026-11-04): inner planes (D12-1/D17 A), the 60 A entry path on B, In2, In3 and the F band (D18 A), VBAT_PROT at the disconnect FETs' sources, GND pours, and via fields at 0.65 A per 0.45/0.25 mm via (D12-6). Stage 2: each switch's VBB pad gets in-pad vias (filled and capped, DEC-027); each output a pour on B and F from its pins to its header's pin 1, OUTb the mirror image of OUTa, with mirrored via fields so both outputs of a switch get the same copper. D19 A (2026-11-04): the cells' small parts moved clear of the OUT exits; the B output pours reach north to y 104.5 beside the pins (F stays south of the VBAT_IN bar area).",
